'''Super Devil''' (スーパーデビル, ''Sūpā Debiru'', '''Super Devil''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Super Devil
|image = E 452.png
|appearance = [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
Super Devil is not very powerful, but can slow cats for 4 whole seconds with long distance attacks. Its damage can also be problematic when magnified, making it act almost like a stronger [[Tackey]].

==Strategy==
Super Devil's main weakness is its blind spot, which makes this unit very vulnerable to rushers, especially those with a short backswing like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]].

